flowchart TB
    accTitle: Topic Branch And Bilingual Pull Request Workflow
    accDescr: Changes are scoped in an Issue or PR, developed on a topic branch, committed with bilingual summaries and reviewed through a bilingual PR. Maintainers merge after relevant checks and review. Simulator fork changes have their own PR and pinned dependency. Server enforcement is configured separately.
    scope["Issue or PR: scope / case / dependencies"] --> branch["Topic branch or worktree"]
    branch --> commits["Focused bilingual commits"]
    commits --> pr["Bilingual PR: purpose / changes / validation / rollback"]
    pr --> review["Relevant checks and non-author review"]
    review --> merge["Maintainer: merge commit through PR"]
    branch -. "if simulator changes are needed" .-> fork_pr["Separate simulator fork PR"]
    fork_pr --> pin["Review dependency and pin available revision"]
    pin --> pr
    classDef process fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d
    classDef external fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a
    class scope,branch,commits,pr,review,merge process
    class fork_pr,pin external
